  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction: The lady &amp; the sailor is a Los Angeles based Collection developed in 2009 by designer Brittany Correy. Hints of global inspiration are found in each garment. Our designers often travel to Portugal, Japan, Bali, and Morocco in pursuit of new textiles, designs, and techniques. The colors, textures, and experiences all culminate to the next Collection with campaigns and imagery shot in the most exquisite locations across the globe. Effortless and eclectic, yet playfully sophisticated. Pack your suitcase and let the lady &amp; the sailor take you wherever in the world you choose to explore.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Product description: Beautifully uncomplicated clothes for a well-lived life. Each garment is distinctly crafted with travel in mind. The collection is characterized by effortlessly chic silhouettes crafted from soft and easy to pack fabrics. Cover Ups for relaxed days in the sun. Luxe Cotton Sweats for a polished travel day. Polished Poplin Shirting for every occasion. Pack your suitcase and let the lady &amp; the sailor take you wherever in the world you choose to explore.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): Designed and made entirely in Los Angeles California. Women owned and entirely women operated.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Payment terms:&nbsp;<br>&bull; Other information:</p>\r\n</div>",
